<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln Sfr five-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln Sfr five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER    LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50 PCT  MATURITY    31.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.00    PAY DATE    31.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AA+	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	WITH REOPENING CLAUSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
